What is Agentic Coding Tool..?
Agentic Coding Tool that reads your codebase, edits files, runs commands, and integrates with your development tools.

What is Code Harness..?
Code Harness is the surrounding program that makes an LLM into an agent include features such as: engineered prompts, tools, sandboxes, and more harness often interact across multiple surfaces.

most agentic coding tools are code harnesses.

